WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Build your transport empire.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Connect a coal mine to a power station.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Build a station at each end.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Choose a coal train. Give it a route.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.900
Deliver the coal. Earn income.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.000
First delivery: $1,965. Delivery income before costs.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Later on the same line: 121 tonnes waiting. More coal to move.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Build a passing loop.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Add a second coal train.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Give both trains room to run.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Serve towns by road.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Connect towns by air.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Bring passengers into town.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Cross the water by ferry.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Build a world that keeps moving.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Fourways. Play the free Windows and Mac preview at fourways-game.com.
